Firecrawl API (modified fork)

This repository is a modified fork of Firecrawl, originally published by the
Firecrawl authors (Mendable) at https://github.com/firecrawl/firecrawl. It
keeps upstream's API server (apps/api) and its in-tree build dependencies.
Upstream states that the project is primarily licensed under AGPL-3.0; this
fork contains no separately MIT-licensed SDK or UI code.

